description:
Loads the ESA CCI / C3S land cover classes (esacci_landcover_class_yearly) and merges its 37 classes into ten groups following the IPCC land categories, with shrubland, sparse vegetation and bare land kept apart: cropland, tree_cover, shrubland, grassland, sparse_vegetation, wetland, urban, bare, water and snow_ice. The result is a categorical cube whose classes are the groups, so aggregate_spatial_classes gives each group's share of each feature, or the group covering most of it.

Share of each group per district for 2020, as a process graph:

{
  "groups": {
    "process_id": "esacci_landcover_groups",
    "arguments": { "temporal_extent": ["2020-01-01", "2020-12-31"] }
  },
  "share": {
    "process_id": "aggregate_spatial_classes",
    "arguments": {
      "data": { "from_node": "groups" },
      "geometries": { "type": "FeatureCollection", "features": [ ... ] },
      "reducer": "share"
    }
  },
  "save": {
    "process_id": "save_result",
    "arguments": { "data": { "from_node": "share" }, "format": "CSV" },
    "result": true
  }
}
